# What the image build may read. The `source` target needs these paths from
# the repository root; the `release` target reads only requirements.txt and
# fetch-model.py from its context, this directory.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src
!deploy/requirements.txt
!deploy/fetch-model.py
!requirements.txt
!fetch-model.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
